": "unprecedented crisis over the past few years, ranging from the COVID-19 pandemic", "words": [[29.24, 30.02, " unprecedented"], [30.02, 30.62, " crisis"], [30.62, 30.9, " over"], [30.9, 31.06, " the"], [31.06, 31.32, " past"], [31.32, 31.52, " few"], [31.52, 31.94, " years,"], [32.24, 32.64, " ranging"], [32.64, 32.92, " from"], [32.92, 33.06, " the"], [33.06, 33.28, " COVID"], [33.28, 33.64, "-19"], [33.64, 34.16, " pandemic"]]}, {"start": 34.16, "end": 39.88, "text": "economic to the West Asia crisis. The price to say that it is a matter of pride for 140", "words": [[34.16, 34.48, " economic"], [34.48, 34.66, " to"], [34.66, 34.8, " the"], [34.8, 35.0, " West"], [35.0, 35.34, " Asia"], [35.34, 35.88, " crisis."], [36.68, 37.1, " The"], [37.1, 37.32, " price"], [37.32, 37.5, " to"], [37.5, 37.64, " say"], [37.64, 37.86, " that"], [37.86, 38.0, " it"], [38.0, 38.1, " is"], [38.1, 38.22, " a"], [38.22, 38.4, " matter"], [38.4, 38.6, " of"], [38.6, 38.84, " pride"], [38.84, 39.04, " for"], [39.04, 39.88, " 140"]]}, {"start": 39.88, "end": 44.6, "text": "crore Indians that the country has so far managed these global challenges effectively.", "words": [[39.88, 40.32, " crore"], [40.32, 40.66, " Indians"], [40.66, 41.28, " that"], [41.28, 41.4, " the"], [41.4, 41.64, " country"], [41.64, 41.9, " has"], [41.9, 42.1, " so"], [42.1, 42.34, " far"], [42.34, 42.76, " managed"], [42.76, 43.06, " these"], [43.06, 43.34, " global"], [43.34, 43.9, " challenges"], [43.9, 44.6, " effectively."]]}, {"start": 45.2, "end": 51.48, "text": "Mr. Modi added that despite these crisis, India has sustained a high growth. He is certain", "words": [[45.2, 45.42, " Mr."], [45.52, 45.64, " Modi"], [45.64, 45.92, " added"], [45.92, 46.54, " that"], [46.54, 46.96, " despite"], [46.96, 47.4, " these"], [47.4, 47.94, " crisis,"], [48.42, 48.7, " India"], [48.7, 49.04, " has"], [49.04, 49.46, " sustained"], [49.46, 49.76, " a"], [49.76, 49.92, " high"], [49.92, 50.34, " growth."], [50.82, 51.08, "